          "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T11:47:02.736Z",
          "changelog": "- **分类声明（R4-2.8/2.9）**：`plugin.json` 顶层补 `category: \"development\"` ＋ `categories: [\"code-editing\"]`——商店分类抽屉归位，随本次发版进入官方目录条目。"
